    "11": {
      "note": "This registrar delegates transaction eligibility and execution to their established owners. Its compact descriptions name reached states, blocked/refused outcomes and state/next/log presentation, with docs/reference/mcp-tools.md carrying the longer account. Reachable task-state refusals retain original codes/check order and occur before writes; a blocked dry run agrees with the blocked real call rather than promising would-succeed. Short descriptions are not a substitute for checkpoint-versus-pause, archival, approval or publication predicates, and do not assert every internal exception was converted.",
